{"answerArea":{"calculator":false,"chi2Table":false,"periodicTable":false,"tTable":false,"zTable":false},"hints":[{"content":"$\\begin{align}\n\\sqrt[7]{v^3}\u0026=\\left(v^3\\right)^{^{\\scriptsize\\dfrac17}}\n\\\\\\\\\n\u0026=v^{^{\\scriptsize\\dfrac37}}\n\\end{align}$\n\nSo $\\left(v^3\\right)^{^{\\scriptsize\\dfrac17}}$ and $v^{^{\\scriptsize\\dfrac37}}$ are both correct.","images":{},"replace":false,"widgets":{}},{"content":"$\\begin{align}\n\\left(\\sqrt[3]{v}\\right)^7\u0026=\\left(v^{^{\\scriptsize\\dfrac13}}\\right)^7\n\\\\\\\\\n\u0026=v^{^{\\scriptsize\\dfrac73}}\n\\\\\\\\\n\u0026\\neq v^{^{\\scriptsize\\dfrac37}}\n\\end{align}$\n\nSo $\\left(\\sqrt[3]{v}\\right)^7$ isn't correct.","images":{},"replace":false,"widgets":{}},{"content":"In conclusion, these are the correct answers:\n\n- $v^{^{\\scriptsize\\dfrac{3}{7}}}$\n- $\\left(v^3\\right){^{^{\\scriptsize\\dfrac{1}{7}}}}$","images":{},"replace":false,"widgets":{}}],"itemDataVersion":{"major":0,"minor":1},"question":{"content":"**Which expressions are equivalent to $\\sqrt[7]{v^3}$ ?**\n\n[[☃ radio 1]]","images":{},"widgets":{"radio 1":{"alignment":"default","graded":true,"options":{"choices":[{"content":"$v^{^{\\scriptsize\\dfrac{3}{7}}}$","correct":true},{"content":"$\\left(v^3\\right){^{^{\\scriptsize\\dfrac{1}{7}}}}$","correct":true},{"content":"$\\left(\\sqrt[3]{v}\\right)^7$","isNoneOfTheAbove":false},{"isNoneOfTheAbove":true}],"countChoices":false,"deselectEnabled":false,"displayCount":null,"hasNoneOfTheAbove":true,"multipleSelect":true,"randomize":true},"static":false,"type":"radio","version":{"major":1,"minor":0}}}}}
